    "starterFiles": [
     {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# 用单摆测重力加速度\n\n1. 把你的测量结果填进 `data.csv`（摆长单位：米；`time_10` 是 10 次全振动的总时间，单位：秒）。\n2. 运行 `python analyze.py`。\n3. 完成 `analyze.py` 里的 TODO，得到 g 并写下误差分析。\n"
     },
     {
      "path": "data.csv",
      "content": "length_m,time_10_s\n0.30,11.02\n0.45,13.48\n0.60,15.55\n0.75,17.41\n0.90,19.05\n"
     },
     {
      "path": "analyze.py",
      "content": "import csv\nimport math\n\n# 读取数据\nrows = list(csv.DictReader(open(\"data.csv\", encoding=\"utf-8\")))\nL = [float(r[\"length_m\"]) for r in rows]\nT = [float(r[\"time_10_s\"]) / 10 for r in rows]\n\n# TODO 1：计算每个摆长对应的 T 的平方\nT2 = []\n\n# TODO 2：对 T2 关于 L 做最小二乘线性拟合，求斜率 k\n# 提示：k = Σ(L - L̄)(T2 - T̄2) / Σ(L - L̄)²\nk = None\n\n# TODO 3：由 T² = (4π²/g)·L 求 g\ng = None\n\nprint(\"g =\", g)\n"
     }
    ],
    "unitId": "unt_mvj17cdpr0g946"
