  "les_mvj17cdo68p7rq": {
   "title": "从圆周运动看简谐运动",
   "steps": [
    {
     "id": "s1",
     "say": "上一讲我们看到，弹簧振子的位置随时间变成一条波浪线。这条曲线到底从哪里来？答案藏在一个匀速旋转的圆里。",
     "ops": [
      {
       "id": "o1",
       "t": "title",
       "text": "从圆周运动看简谐运动"
      },
      {
       "id": "o2",
       "t": "h",
       "text": "一个关键的想象"
      },
      {
       "id": "o3",
       "t": "p",
       "text": "圆周运动的**影子**会怎样运动？"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s2",
     "say": "想象一个小球沿着圆周匀速转动，从侧面用光照它。墙上的影子会上下来回移动。仔细看右边画出的轨迹，是不是和上一讲的波浪线一模一样？",
     "ops": [
      {
       "id": "o4",
       "t": "anim",
       "html": "<!doctype html><html><head><style>html,body{margin:0;background:transparent}canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}</style></head><body><canvas id=\"c\" width=\"600\" height=\"280\"></canvas><script>\nconst c=document.getElementById('c'),g=c.getContext('2d');const R=92,cx=130,cy=140,X0=290;let t=0;const trail=[];\nfunction frame(){g.clearRect(0,0,600,280);g.lineWidth=1.6;g.strokeStyle='rgba(120,120,130,.6)';g.beginPath();g.arc(cx,cy,R,0,Math.PI*2);g.stroke();\ng.beginPath();g.moveTo(cx-R-14,cy);g.lineTo(cx+R+14,cy);g.moveTo(X0,cy);g.lineTo(590,cy);g.stroke();\nconst px=cx+R*Math.cos(t),py=cy-R*Math.sin(t);g.strokeStyle='#2f6fde';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(cx,cy);g.lineTo(px,py);g.stroke();\ng.fillStyle='#2f6fde';g.beginPath();g.arc(px,py,7,0,7);g.fill();g.setLineDash([5,5]);g.strokeStyle='#e08a1e';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(px,py);g.lineTo(X0,py);g.stroke();g.setLineDash([]);\ng.strokeStyle='rgba(120,120,130,.9)';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(X0,40);g.lineTo(X0,240);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#d64545';g.beginPath();g.arc(X0,py,7,0,7);g.fill();\ntrail.unshift(py);if(trail.length>290)trail.pop();g.strokeStyle='#d64545';g.lineWidth=2.4;g.beginPath();trail.forEach((y,i)=>{const x=X0+i;i?g.lineTo(x,y):g.moveTo(x,y)});g.stroke();\nt+=0.028;requestAnimationFrame(frame)}frame();\n</script></body></html>",
       "height": 280,
       "caption": "蓝点匀速转圈，红点是它在竖直方向上的“影子”",
       "poster": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 280\" width=\"600\" height=\"280\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"140\" r=\"92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#787882\" stroke-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"24\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#787882\" stroke-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"290\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#787882\" stroke-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"290\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#787882\" stroke-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<polyline points=\"290,60.6 292,58.1 294,55.9 296,53.9 298,52.3 300,50.8 302,49.7 304,48.9 306,48.3 308,48.0 310,48.0 312,48.3 314,48.9 316,49.8 318,51.0 320,52.4 322,54.1 324,56.1 326,58.3 328,60.8 330,63.6 332,66.6 334,69.8 336,73.2 338,76.9 340,80.7 342,84.8 344,89.0 346,93.3 348,97.8 350,102.5 352,107.2 354,112.1 356,117.1 358,122.1 360,127.2 362,132.3 364,137.4 366,142.6 368,147.7 370,152.8 372,157.9 374,162.9 376,167.9 378,172.8 380,177.5 382,182.2 384,186.7 386,191.0 388,195.2 390,199.3 392,203.1 394,206.8 396,210.2 398,213.4 400,216.4 402,219.2 404,221.7 406,223.9 408,225.9 410,227.6 412,229.0 414,230.2 416,231.1 418,231.7 420,232.0 422,232.0 424,231.7 426,231.1 428,230.3 430,229.2 432,227.7 434,226.1 436,224.1 438,221.9 440,219.4 442,216.7 444,213.7 446,210.5 448,207.1 450,203.5 452,199.7 454,195.6 456,191.5 458,187.1 460,182.6 462,178.0 464,173.2 466,168.4 468,163.4 470,158.4 472,153.3 474,148.2 476,143.1 478,137.9 480,132.8 482,127.7 484,122.6 486,117.6 488,112.6 490,107.7 492,103.0 494,98.3 496,93.8 498,89.4 500,85.2 502,81.1 504,77.3 506,73.6 508,70.1 510,66.9 512,63.9 514,61.1 516,58.6 518,56.3 520,54.3 522,52.6 524,51.1 526,49.9 528,49.0 530,48.4 532,48.1 534,48.0 536,48.3 538,48.8 540,49.6 542,50.7 544,52.1 546,53.8 548,55.7 550,57.9 552,60.3 554,63.0 556,66.0 558,69.1 560,72.5 562,76.1 564,79.9 566,83.9 568,88.1 570,92.4 572,96.9 574,101.5 576,106.3 578,111.1 580,116.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d64545\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<line x1=\"130\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"83.6\" y2=\"60.6\" stroke=\"#2f6fde\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n<line x1=\"83.6\" y1=\"60.6\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"60.6\" stroke=\"#e08a1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"83.6\" cy=\"60.6\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#2f6fde\"/>\n<circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"60.6\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d64545\"/>\n</svg>"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s3",
     "say": "设圆的半径是 A，小球转过的角度是 ω t 加上起始角 φ，那么影子的位置，就是 A 乘以这个角度的余弦。",
     "ops": [
      {
       "id": "o5",
       "t": "math",
       "tex": "x(t)=A\\cos(\\omega t+\\varphi)",
       "text": "x(t) = A·cos(ωt + φ)"
      },
      {
       "id": "o6",
       "t": "list",
       "items": [
        "$A$：振幅，也就是圆的半径",
        "$\\omega$：角频率，转得有多快",
        "$\\varphi$：初相位，从哪里开始转"
       ],
       "ordered": false
      }
     ],
     "check": {
      "id": "k3",
      "kind": "choice",
      "prompt": "把参考圆的半径变成原来的 2 倍，影子振动的哪个量会变成 2 倍？",
      "explanation": "半径就是振幅；转速不变，所以周期和频率都不变。",
      "hints": [],
      "difficulty": 2,
      "conceptIds": [
       "cpt_mvj17cdou3tllg"
      ],
      "options": [
       {
        "id": "a",
        "text": "振幅"
       },
       {
        "id": "b",
        "text": "周期"
       },
       {
        "id": "c",
        "text": "频率"
       },
       {
        "id": "d",
        "text": "初相位"
       }
      ],
      "answer": "a"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "s4",
     "say": "小球转一整圈所用的时间就是周期 T。一圈是 2π 弧度，所以 ω 等于 2π 除以 T，也等于 2π 乘以频率。",
     "ops": [
      {
       "id": "o7",
       "t": "col"
      },
      {
       "id": "o8",
       "t": "h",
       "text": "周期与角频率"
      },
      {
       "id": "o9",
       "t": "math",
       "tex": "\\omega=\\frac{2\\pi}{T}=2\\pi f",
       "text": "ω = 2π/T = 2πf"
      },
      {
       "id": "o10",
       "t": "p",
       "text": "转得越快 → $\\omega$ 越大 → 周期越短"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s5",
     "say": "弹簧振子的 ω 由什么决定？可以证明，ω 的平方等于 k 除以 m。弹簧越硬，振得越快；物体越重，振得越慢。",
     "ops": [
      {
       "id": "o11",
       "t": "math",
       "tex": "\\omega=\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{m}},\\qquad T=2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}}",
       "text": "ω = √(k/m)，T = 2π√(m/k)"
      },
      {
       "id": "o12",
       "t": "note",
       "text": "周期和振幅无关！拉得远一点，跑得也快一点，用时刚好一样。",
       "tone": "tip"
      }
     ],
     "check": {
      "id": "k5",
      "kind": "number",
      "prompt": "$k = 100$ N/m、$m = 1$ kg 的弹簧振子，角频率 $\\omega$ 是多少 rad/s？",
